<title>UK: UK's JLI says talks about possible bid ended.</title>
<headline>UK's JLI says talks about possible bid ended.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British food products supplier JLI Group Plc said on Friday all discussions that could lead to an offer being made for the company had been terminated.</p>
<p>On February 26, JLI said it received preliminary approaches that might lead to an offer being made.</p>
<p>JLI said the group's continuing operations were in line with management's expectations.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
